# Give a Moogle a Break (otherAreas 100): the Moogle of Bastok Mines' Mog House (its script: xi.moghouse.moogleTrigger,
# the Moogle menu; moogleTrade: nothing). A Bastok char (nation 1) with fame level 3 (125) and a bed placed 61 seconds
# before the clock (bedPlacedTime 1799999939, a GM: no furniture step; the Bronze Bed's onFurniturePlaced writes it).
# AMK 1 off (ENABLE_AMK 0: its 30023 ties at the Moogle: #kinds). Into the Mog House: the zone's only line to itself
# (zmrg). Available: the bow and the ring traded: no quest trade: the script's (nothing). The Moogle 30005 (0, 0, 0, 5,
# 0, Power Bow, Beetle Ring), option 0: questSeen 1, not begun. questSeen 0 (a GM): 30005 again at once (Progress: an
# Event would take the fallback turn, the menu first). Again: questSeen 1: no section: the menu. Out of the zone and
# back (questSeen is a local var): 30005, option 1: begun. Accepted, questSeen 1: nil: the menu. Out and back: Prog 0:
# 30006 (0, 0, 0, 0, 0, the bow, the ring), finished: questSeen 1; questSeen 0 (a GM): 30006 again at once, finished:
# questSeen 1: nil: the menu. The bow and the ring traded: 30007, finished: both taken, Prog 1, Timer now + 60; the two
# again (GMs), traded: 30007 again at once. Out and back: Prog 1, the Timer ahead: nil: the menu. A day later (wait
# jst=1): 30008, finished: completed (Mog's Kind Master), the Mog Safe and Mog Safe 2 + 10. Available, then accepted
# again with Prog 1 (GMs: a status set back from completed keeps the completed bit, so available first): 30008 again at
# once, finished: completed again (the safes + 10 again). Completed: no section: the menu.
lists BastokMines/Moogle/onTrigger BastokMines/Moogle/onTrade BastokMines/onEventFinish/30005 BastokMines/onEventFinish/30006 BastokMines/onEventFinish/30007 BastokMines/onEventFinish/30008
char zone=BastokMines pos=116.9,-1.6,-72 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
setting ENABLE_AMK 0                    # AMK 1 (30023 at the Moogle) off: #kinds shows it
fame Bastok 125
charvar Quest[4][100]bedPlacedTime 1799999939
item PowerBow
item BeetleRing
login
zoneline BastokMines                    # into the Mog House (zmrg: the zone's only line to itself)
trade Moogle PowerBow x1 BeetleRing x1  # available: no quest trade; the script's moogleTrade: nothing
trigger Moogle                          # available: 30005
finish option=0                         # questSeen 1; not begun
localvar Quest[4][100]questSeen 0       # a GM
trigger Moogle                          # 30005 again at once (Progress: no fallback turn)
finish option=0                         # questSeen 1; not begun
trigger Moogle                          # questSeen 1: section 1 off: the Moogle menu
warp -6,0,-50 BastokMarkets             # out (the local questSeen cleared)
warp 116.9,-1.6,-72 BastokMines
zoneline BastokMines                    # back in
trigger Moogle                          # 30005
finish option=1                         # questSeen 1; begun
trigger Moogle                          # accepted, questSeen 1: nil; the menu
warp -6,0,-50 BastokMarkets
warp 116.9,-1.6,-72 BastokMines
zoneline BastokMines
trigger Moogle                          # Prog 0: 30006
finish                                  # questSeen 1
localvar Quest[4][100]questSeen 0       # a GM
trigger Moogle                          # 30006 again at once (Progress: no fallback turn)
finish                                  # questSeen 1
trigger Moogle                          # questSeen 1: nil; the menu
trade Moogle PowerBow x1 BeetleRing x1  # 30007
finish                                  # both taken; Prog 1; Timer now + 60
item PowerBow                           # a GM
item BeetleRing                         # a GM
trade Moogle PowerBow x1 BeetleRing x1  # 30007 again at once (Progress: no fallback turn)
finish                                  # both taken; Prog 1; Timer now + 60
warp -6,0,-50 BastokMarkets
warp 116.9,-1.6,-72 BastokMines
zoneline BastokMines
trigger Moogle                          # Prog 1, Timer ahead: nil; the menu
wait jst=1                              # the Timer passed (GetSystemTime moves by days only)
trigger Moogle                          # Timer < now: 30008
finish                                  # completed; Mog's Kind Master; Mog Safe and Mog Safe 2 + 10
quest OtherAreas.GiveAMoogleABreak available # a GM: the completed bit cleared
quest OtherAreas.GiveAMoogleABreak accepted # a GM: accepted again
charvar Quest[4][100]Prog 1             # a GM (the Timer cleared: 0 < now)
trigger Moogle                          # 30008 again at once (Progress: no fallback turn)
finish                                  # completed again; the safes + 10 again
trigger Moogle                          # completed: no section (Picnic: fame 3 < 5); the menu
